# Direct BLS (v3.3.0+) Interchain validator networking.
# This is a TEMPLATE. All source/destination registry addresses below must be
# populated from NEW, verified GitHub deployment receipts after the hard reset.
# NEVER reuse registry addresses from pre-reset Merkle deployments.
# Permissionless Factory route registration requires NO governance approval.
# BLS quorum controls individual message security, validator membership and fees.
# XGRChain hub: chain/domain 1643. Configure the chains being supported.
#
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_BASE_CHAIN_ID=8453
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_BASE_DOMAIN=8453
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_BASE_REGISTRY_ADDR=<NEW_BASE_VALIDATOR_REGISTRY>
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_BASE_ILN_REGISTRY_ADDR=<NEW_BASE_SOURCE_REGISTRY>
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_BASE_RPC=https://mainnet.base.org
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_BASE_CONFIRMATIONS=12
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_BASE_VERIFIER_FORMAT=eip2537
#
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_ARBITRUM_CHAIN_ID=42161
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_ARBITRUM_DOMAIN=42161
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_ARBITRUM_REGISTRY_ADDR=<NEW_ARB_VALIDATOR_REGISTRY>
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_ARBITRUM_ILN_REGISTRY_ADDR=<NEW_ARB_SOURCE_REGISTRY>
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_ARBITRUM_RPC=https://arb1.arbitrum.io/rpc
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_ARBITRUM_CONFIRMATIONS=64
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_ARBITRUM_VERIFIER_FORMAT=eip2537
#
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_XGR_CHAIN_ID=1643
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_XGR_DOMAIN=1643
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_XGR_REGISTRY_ADDR=<NEW_XGR_VALIDATOR_REGISTRY>
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_XGR_ILN_REGISTRY_ADDR=<NEW_XGR_SOURCE_REGISTRY>
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_XGR_RPC=http://127.0.0.1:8545
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_XGR_CONFIRMATIONS=1
# XGR_INTERCHAIN_XGR_VERIFIER_FORMAT=compressed
#
# Add other required membership validity, fee reserve and executor settings
# from the running node configuration. Do not add static per-token route lists.
